@def MICRO_OS_PLUS_MICRO_TEST_PLUS_TRACE_CONSTRUCTORS_ENABLED
@brief Enables the trace messages of the µTest++ constructors and
destructors.

@details
Displays trace messages in the constructors and destructors of the µTest++
Testing Framework, through `trace::printf()`, which writes them only when
`MICRO_OS_PLUS_DIAG_TRACE_ENABLED` is also defined.

The code compiled with this macro includes `micro-os-plus/diag/trace.h`, of
the µOS++ `diag-trace` package, which must be in the include path of the
build; without it, the compilation fails.
